7. Debt-to-CreditScore Ratio (Debt / CreditScore): Demonstrates financial stress relative to creditworthiness.
8. Ethnicity and Citizenship (ethnicity_encoded, citizen_encoded): Encoded demographic contexts influencing credit assessments.
9. Log-transformed Debt (log_debt): Reduces skewness effects for high debt values.

These features and interactions capture critical dimensions of stability, financial health, and demographic indicators.

